---
diagram_type: arch
title: Campus Library application
---
Internet "Reader browsers" as readers
Server "Catalogue and circulation API" as api [color: #3D698A]
Database "Library database" as db {
  type: 'postgres'
  Note: 'Stores books, members, and loans.'
}

Group "Campus deployment" as campus {
  api
  db
}

Link: readers > api [proto: HTTPS, host: 'library.example.test']
Link: api > db [proto: PostgreSQL]
